{"id":"wb-5-43","name":"铁店窑遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"铁店窑遗址","text":"铁店窑遗址位于中国浙江省金华市婺城区琅琊镇铁店村，是婺州窑的代表性窑址之一，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n铁店窑遗址于1981年被发现，现存窑址三处。一号窑址位于铁店村西约200米的山坡上，面积约两万平方米。二号窑址位于村西南，面积约800平方米。三号窑址位于村中部东南口，面积约1000平方米。发掘的瓷器主要有乳浊釉瓷、青釉瓷、黑釉瓷三种类型。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%93%81%E5%BA%97%E7%AA%91%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":88076167,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88076167","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bbcb425bf1f0de34c765370f.jpg","title":"Jinhua_Tiedian-Yao_Yizhi_2016.12.04_10-30-13.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jinhua_Tiedian-Yao_Yizhi_2016.12.04_10-30-13.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Jinhua_Tiedian-Yao_Yizhi_2016.12.04_10-30-13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"铁店窑遗址","width":320,"height":213}}